{
  "name": "自动归档竞品 Google 广告及文案至 Google 表格",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 归档竞品广告至 Google 表格\n\n自动监控竞品最新营销投放，将广告素材、OCR 识别的标题文案、落地页链接及投放区域归档至 Google 表格。\n\n## 表格所需列\n`advertiser` · `format` · `headline` · `description` · `display_url` · `first_shown` · `ad_url` · `logged_at`\n\n## 配置（仅需一次）\n\n**1. 获取 Apify Token** — https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations\n\n**2. 创建 n8n 凭据**\n凭据 → 新建 → **Header Auth**\n- 名称: `Apify API`\n- Header name: `Authorization`\n- Header value: `Bearer 你的_APIFY_TOKEN`\n\n所有 HTTP 节点均已配置指向该凭据，工作流文件中不包含任何密钥。\n\n## 计费说明\n\n按事件付费：每返回 1,000 条广告从 $0.70 起（Free 阶梯 $0.0012，Gold 阶梯低至 $0.0007），监控模式每次竞品检测 $0.01。仅返回 Google 官方 firstShown 时间确属新上线的广告。\n\n当前价格详情：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/google-ads-monitor/pricing\n\nActor 页面：https://apify.com/sumitr_mardy/google-ads-monitor\n模板与开源仓库：https://github.com/sumitrmardy/google-ads-monitor-api",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "t2-sticky",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "t2-trigger-manual",
      "name": "When clicking 'Execute workflow'",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        100,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "9627b5e7-4050-4a0c-82a2-4de483e2921f",
              "name": "target",
              "value": "hubspot.com",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "t2-trigger",
      "name": "输入竞品列表",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        320,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/sumitr_mardy~google-ads-monitor/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ targets: [ $json.target ], mode: 'monitor' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000
        }
      },
      "id": "t2-check",
      "name": "拉取新增广告 (Apify)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        100
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "apify-api",
          "name": "Apify API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map(item => ({\n  json: {\n    advertiser: item.json.advertiserName || '',\n    format: item.json.format || '',\n    headline: item.json.headline || '',\n    description: item.json.description || '',\n    display_url: item.json.displayUrl || '',\n    first_shown: item.json.firstShown || '',\n    ad_url: item.json.adUrl || '',\n    logged_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}));"
      },
      "id": "t2-format",
      "name": "格式化广告行数据",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        800,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Sheet1",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData"
        }
      },
      "id": "t2-sheet",
      "name": "追加至 Google 表格",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1040,
        100
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "输入竞品列表": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "拉取新增广告 (Apify)",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "拉取新增广告 (Apify)": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "格式化广告行数据",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "格式化广告行数据": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "追加至 Google 表格",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "When clicking 'Execute workflow'": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "输入竞品列表",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}
